# Next.js CMS Architecture

## Stack
- Next.js 14+ App Router (RSC + Server Actions)
- Supabase PostgreSQL + Drizzle ORM (`src/lib/db/schema.ts`)
- Supabase Storage for media uploads (`src/lib/cms/storage.ts`)
- Better Auth with RBAC (admin, editor, author, viewer)
- shadcn/ui + Tailwind CSS
- React Hook Form + Zod (shared schemas in `src/lib/validations/`)
- Tiptap rich text (JSONB body column)

## Rules
- Fetch data in Server Components via Drizzle; mutate via Server Actions in `src/actions/`
- Enforce RBAC with `requireRole()` / `canPerform()` before every mutation
- Protect `/admin/*` via middleware (`src/middleware.ts`)
- Content statuses: draft, review, scheduled, published, archived
- Store rich text + layout in PostgreSQL `jsonb` columns
- Use `'use client'` only for interactive components (forms, tables, editor)
- Shared Zod schemas between forms and Server Actions
- Upload images via `/api/upload` → Supabase Storage public URLs
